#   megan "Like I told you last night, I have friends in high places."
    megan "Como eu te disse ontem à noite, tenho amigos influentes."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_01_The_MC_Goes_to_the_Art_Gallery_with_Vivian.rpy:705
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_goes_to_the_art_gallery_22c443b2:

#   megan "As well as eyes and ears to the ground. One of my guys said he has a reliable source."
    megan "Além de olhos e ouvidos no terreno. Um dos meus homens disse que tem uma fonte confiável."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_01_The_MC_Goes_to_the_Art_Gallery_with_Vivian.rpy:708
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_goes_to_the_art_gallery_d1f02001:

#   megan "According to an online discussion that he intercepted, an exchange of goods is taking place there later this afternoon."
    megan "Segundo uma discussão online que ele interceptou, uma troca de mercadorias ocorrerá lá ainda hoje à tarde."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_01_The_MC_Goes_to_the_Art_Gallery_with_Vivian.rpy:710
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_goes_to_the_art_gallery_cf1c28b3:

#   mc "(An exchange?)"
    mc "(Uma troca?)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_01_The_MC_Goes_to_the_Art_Gallery_with_Vivian.rpy:711
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_goes_to_the_art_gallery_ef515d88:

#   mc "(Shit! That might be the girl trying to sell the flash drive!)"
    mc "(Droga! Essa pode ser a garota tentando vender o pen drive!)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_01_The_MC_Goes_to_the_Art_Gallery_with_Vivian.rpy:713
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_goes_to_the_art_gallery_a4e6e4c3:

#   mc "So you want me to scope this place out, see if anyone is in there, and then report back to you, right?"
    mc "Então você quer que eu dê uma olhada neste lugar, veja se tem alguém lá dentro e depois te informe, certo?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_01_The_MC_Goes_to_the_Art_Gallery_with_Vivian.rpy:715
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_goes_to_the_art_gallery_8cfcadfa:

#   megan "Exactly."
    megan "Exatamente."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_01_The_MC_Goes_to_the_Art_Gallery_with_Vivian.rpy:717
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_goes_to_the_art_gallery_1f427932:

#   megan "Do that for me, and we'll take care of the rest."
    megan "Faça isso por mim, e nós cuidaremos do resto."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_01_The_MC_Goes_to_the_Art_Gallery_with_Vivian.rpy:719
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_goes_to_the_art_gallery_521ff134:

#   megan "And if that girl is there, then I'll make sure you have the time with her to retrieve that drive you've been looking for."
    megan "E se essa garota estiver lá, então eu garanto que você terá tempo suficiente com ela para recuperar aquele pen drive que você está procurando."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_01_The_MC_Goes_to_the_Art_Gallery_with_Vivian.rpy:720
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_goes_to_the_art_gallery_ed885c41:

#   mc "(It seems to good to be true, but I have to check it out.)"
    mc "(Parece bom demais para ser verdade, mas preciso verificar.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_01_The_MC_Goes_to_the_Art_Gallery_with_Vivian.rpy:722
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_goes_to_the_art_gallery_46d87156:

#   mc "What time do you want me to go there?"
    mc "A que horas você quer que eu vá lá?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_01_The_MC_Goes_to_the_Art_Gallery_with_Vivian.rpy:724
translate brazil lb_ep01_The_MC_goes_to_the_art_gallery_ad070623:

#   megan "The exchange is supposed to take place around five-thirty, according to our source."
    megan "De acordo com nossa fonte, a troca deverá ocorrer por volta das cinco e meia."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 4/14_01_The_MC_Goes_to_the_Art_Gallery_with_Vivian.rpy:726
